{"version":1,"content":"<p>39歲的內地女星張馨予年前閃嫁圈外老公何捷，婚後育有7歲女兒。</p><p>近日已鮮有影視作品的她集中火力商演及拍攝綜藝節目搵真銀，近日更接連出席三亞國際婚紗時裝周及上海品牌活動，無論外貌及身材都保養得宜，甫現身即驚艷全場。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:24:24.681984+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_hash":"f58c0eda02a36568b40756ebd5f9c311b107c35cca45c68aef5fac6bb0b1b0f0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}